# The site reads one optional variable: PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION, the
# Google Search Console verification code (astro.config.ts's env schema; or
# set `site.googleVerification` in astro-paper.config.ts). Its name is
# src/site.ts, and everything else it is configured with is
# astro-paper.config.ts. A deploy sets PUBLIC_SITE_URL itself (component.yaml).
# PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
